{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24723","headline":"三谣 蟠木谣 · 白居易","name":"三谣 蟠木谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟠木蟠木，有似我身。\n不中乎器，无用於人。\n下拥肿而上辚菌，桷不桷兮轮不轮。\n天子建明堂兮既非梁栋，诸侯斵大辂兮材又不中。\n唯我病夫，或有所用。\n用尔爲几，承吾臂支吾颐而已矣。\n不伤尔性，不枉尔理。\n尔怏怏爲几之外，无所用尔。\n尔既不材，吾亦不材，胡爲乎人间裴回？\n蟠木蟠木，吾与汝归草堂去来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}